---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import SectionHead from '../../components/SectionHead.astro';
import ArticleCards from '../../components/ArticleCards.astro';
import CtaBox from '../../components/CtaBox.astro';
import GuideSignup from '../../components/GuideSignup.astro';
import { SITE, media } from '../../data/site';
import { ingredientGuides } from '../../data/recipes';
import { organization, website, webPage, breadcrumbs } from '../../data/schema';

const path = '/cocktail-ingredients/alcohol-information/';
const title = 'Alcohol Information: All You Need to Know About the Booze in Your Cocktails | ThatCocktail';
const description = 'Ever wondered what that obscure cocktail ingredient is? You’re not alone. Here are all of our alcohol information guides, from triple sec to sloe gin.';

const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Cocktail ingredients', href: '/cocktail-ingredients/' },
  { name: 'Alcohol information', href: path },
];

const schema = [
  organization,
  website,
  webPage({
    path,
    type: 'CollectionPage',
    name: title,
    description,
    extra: {
      breadcrumb: { '@id': `${SITE.url}${path}#breadcrumb` },
      mainEntity: {
        '@type': 'ItemList',
        numberOfItems: ingredientGuides.length,
        itemListElement: ingredientGuides.map((g, i) => ({
          '@type': 'ListItem',
          position: i + 1,
          url: new URL(g.href, SITE.url).href,
          name: g.title,
        })),
      },
    },
  }),
  breadcrumbs(path, crumbs.map((c) => ({ name: c.name, path: c.href }))),
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  ogImage={{ src: media('/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Alcohol-Information.png'), width: 500, height: 300, alt: 'Alcohol Information: all you need to know about the booze in your cocktails' }}
  schema={schema}
>
  <PageHero crumbs={crumbs} title="Alcohol"
    lead="Have you ever looked at a cocktail recipe and not recognised some of the ingredients? Is it a mixer? Is it alcohol? WHAT IS IT? Here’s an alcohol information bomb for you.">
    <Fragment slot="script">information</Fragment>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section" aria-label="About these guides">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>I do this all the time when looking at cocktail menus, and sometimes it puts me off trying a new cocktail. Will I like it? How strong will it be? Will its flavour overpower the rest of the ingredients?</p>
        <p>Just a disclaimer: these guides don’t cover what alcohol is in general. They’re about specific types of alcohol that may not be that common. You’ve probably heard of a lot of these brands, but how much do you actually know about them?</p>
        <p>Yeah, <a href="/what-is-blue-curacao/">blue curaçao</a> has probably been in every blue cocktail you’ve ever had, but what is it actually made of? There’s a guide below that covers that. You get the idea.</p>
        <p>If you want to know more about alcohol in general, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alcoholic_drink" rel="noopener">Wikipedia has a really great entry about it</a>. Otherwise, let’s dive into our guides, and there are more to come!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--mist" aria-labelledby="guides-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <SectionHead id="guides-title" title="Alcohol information guides"
        lede="What’s in the bottle, what it tastes like and how to use it in cocktails." />
      <ArticleCards articles={ingredientGuides} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="buy-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <CtaBox id="buy-title" title="Ready to buy a bottle?"
        lede="Once you know what you’re after, our alcohol recommendations list the brands we rate, from Archers peach schnapps to Cointreau."
        primary={{ label: 'See our alcohol recommendations', href: '/alcohol-recommendations/' }}
        secondary={{ label: 'Alcohol reviews', href: '/cocktail-ingredients/alcohol-reviews/' }} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <GuideSignup />
</BaseLayout>

